  "description": "Beautifully presented,spacious fully furnished one bedroom apt. situated on the second floor of this beautifully restored Georgian Building, ideally located just a stones throw from Grafton St. and within easy access of the IFSC - DART (100 meters) and LUAS links just moments away. An abundance of cafes, restaurants, museums & art galleries are on your doorstep. The property which is one of just four apartments, provides all the convenience of modern living against a backdrop of elegant period features. A sweeping stairway leads you to the apt. which benefits from an elegant livingroom featuring Sash windows & high ceilings. This area also combines a fully fitted kitchen complete with d/washer, w/dryer, f/f and m/wave. The bedroom is large & bright and has fitted wardrobes. The fully tiled Bathroom provides a good-sized shower. The apt. is fully alarmed, heating is electric storage and there is good storage space throughout. Eircom broadband/Vodafone subject to connection and usual charges. Parking is by Residential Disc Permit only, via Dublin City Council. Suit non-smokers only. Lease required. Viewing highly recommended.  Enquiries by email only, please.\n",
